ertainment weekly  it's sort of appalling to me that these  stereotypes were ever put in  in the year 2000 disney released a  so-called uncut version of fantasia to  mark the film's 60th anniversary  keeping otika and sunflower out of sight  with subtle pans and zooms  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movie moments are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

